# Extra skill sources folded into the forestrie scope, lowest precedence first.
# One path per line; '#' comments; ~ and $VAR expanded; missing paths skipped.
#
# The shared team repo owns the Forestrie workflow skills. This scope only adds
# Robin's personal overlay on top (scopes/forestrie/workflow/skills/), which
# wins on name collision because it is applied last.
${FORESTRIE_AGENTS:-$HOME/Dev/personal/forestrie/forestrie-agents}/workflow/skills
